The magnitude of electric field

\begin{aligned}
|E| &=\sqrt{(3)^{2}+(6)^{2}+(2)^{2}} \\
&=\sqrt{9+36+4} \\
&=\sqrt{49}=7
\end{aligned}

The force acting on electron due to electric field

F=q E

\begin{aligned}
|F| &=|q||\mathbf{E}| \\
&=1.6 \times 10^{-19} \times 7 \mathrm{N} \\
&=11.2 \times 10^{-19} \mathrm{N} \\
&=1.12 \times 10^{-18} \mathrm{N}
\end{aligned}

